17:I:X:pit37@c1_fast,9:checks-g1,406:run real11/c1/asks/core.tally real11/c1/facts/2026.tally real11/c1/facts/2027.tally real11/c1/law/pl/benefits.tally real11/c1/law/pl/business.tally real11/c1/law/pl/common.tally real11/c1/law/pl/employment.tally real11/c1/law/pl/wrappers.tally real11/c1/loans.tally real11/c1/pays.tally real11/c1/people.tally real11/c1/places.tally real11/c1/reality.tally real11/c1/records/mbank/2026-09.tally --ask pit37,50210:25:real11/c1/asks/core.tally,1264:part asks_core
